MB-Lab character templates
==========================

These OBJ dummies (f_an01, f_an02, m_an01) are exported from the MB-Lab
humanoid library:

  https://github.com/animate1978/MB-Lab

MB-Lab code is GPL-3.0. The meshes, JSON vertex libraries and generated
3D characters are GNU Affero GPL v3 (AGPL-3.0).

That means: if you ship these 3D models in a game or a network service,
the AGPL copyleft applies to that work. 2D renders are treated more
loosely by the upstream project, but the mesh itself is AGPL.

This workbench keeps them in a separate `kind: body` module. They are
not MakeHuman hm08 morphs and cannot share the clay sliders.

Characters used here:
  F_AN01 / F_AN02 — anime female, shojo style (13995 verts, 13806 quads)
  M_AN01 — anime male, shojo style (13687 verts, 13498 quads)

To rebuild from an MB-Lab checkout:

  python3 factory/export_mblab_obj.py /path/to/MB-Lab
